cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reconstructed synthetic experiment package, please cite the associated AI-QNSF manuscript and record the exact version used."
title: "AI-QNSF Reconstructed Synthetic Experiment"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-12
type: software
abstract: >
  Reconstructed synthetic feature-level benchmark supporting a proposed
  source-aware AI-assisted quantum-network security design. The package
  includes deterministic generators, primary and independent synthetic
  datasets, run-level evaluation scripts, results, environment metadata,
  and integrity checks. It is not an exact reproduction of an earlier
  unarchived experiment and does not model physical QKD operation.
